{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1783256901215,"sessionID":"ses_0cd9bf3d1ffeNd6EqoPMRCtejq","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01_GX70tFS0HHYyIl8QVp8w6648","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"runs/pc-lib-3456/long.js/2026-07-05T13-07-22-517Z/blocks/function_summary.json","content":"{
  "summary": "long.js 是一个纯 JavaScript 64 位补码整数库，派生自 Google Closure Library 的 goog.math.Long 并扩展了无符号支持。由于 JavaScript 的 Number 类型（IEEE 754 双精度）最大安全整数仅为 2^53-1，该库通过两个 32 位有符号整数分别存储高低位，在纯 JS 层面实现完整的 64 位算术（加减乘除取模）、位运算（AND/OR/XOR/NOT/移位/旋转）、比较、字节序列化（大端/小端）及与 BigInt、字符串的互转。可选地利用 WebAssembly 内联模块加速乘法和除法运算，在不支持 WASM 的环境退化为纯 JS 浮点近似算法。以 ES Module 发布并提供 UMD 兼容格式，主要被 Protobuf.js、ByteBuffer.js 等序列化/编解码类库作为底层大整数运算依赖。",
  "categories": [
    {"name": "64 位大整数表示", "description": "用高低 32 位 signed int 存储 64 位补码，支持有符号和无符号两种模式；提供从 Number、BigInt、字符串、字节数组等类型构造 Long 的工厂函数", "evidence": ["index.js:106-134 (构造函数)", "index.js:250-275 (fromNumber)", "index.js:314-357 (fromString)", "index.js:1541-1546 (fromBytesBE)"]},
    {"name": "算术运算", "description": "加减乘除取模——通过 16 位分块算法在 JS 浮点限制内正确计算 64 位结果，WebAssembly 路径加速乘/除/取模", "evidence": ["index.js:916-947 (add)", "index.js:974-1035 (multiply)", "index.js:1052-1150 (divide)", "index.js:1166-1181 (modulo)"]},
    {"name": "位运算", "description": "完整 64 位按位 AND/OR/XOR/NOT、算术/逻辑左右移、循环移位，以及前导零/尾随零计数", "evidence": ["index.js:1248-1273 (and/or/xor)", "index.js:1281-1349 (shiftLeft/shiftRight/shiftRightUnsigned)", "index.js:1373-1435 (rotateLeft/rotateRight)", "index.js:1213-1240 (countLeadingZeros/countTrailingZeros)"]},
    {"name": "比较与判断", "description": "等于/不等/大于/小于/大于等/小于等比较，isZero/isNegative/isPositive/isOdd/isEven/isSafeInteger 状态判断", "evidence": ["index.js:728-737 (equals)", "index.js:868-882 (compare)", "index.js:660-669 (isSafeInteger)"]},
    {"name": "序列化与转换", "description": "大端/小端 8 字节数组序列化（toBytes/fromBytes）；向 Number/BigInt/String 转换；toSigned/toUnsigned 无符号/有符号模式切换", "evidence": ["index.js:1463-1546 (toBytes/fromBytes)", "index.js:557-603 (toString)", "index.js:1557-1578 (fromBigInt/toBigInt)"]},
    {"name": "WebAssembly 加速", "description": "内联 WASM 模块（wasm.wat）使用原生 i64 指令加速乘法、除法、取模——加载成功则替代 JS 分块算法，失败则静默回退", "evidence": ["index.js:22-104 (WASM 加载)", "wasm.wat:1-212 (WAT 模块源码)", "index.js:979-981 (乘法 WASM 路径)"]}
  ],
  "domain": "数学/大整数",
  "target_users": "Node.js 与浏览器 JavaScript 开发者，以及 Protobuf/序列化库等需要精确 64 位整数运算的下游库"
